  "content": "<h3><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><em><strong>英文版本：</strong></em></span></h3><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><h2><span style=\"font-size:24px\">此附加組件為 <strong>COBBLEVERSE 1.7.30 版本</strong> 提供了完整的 <strong>繁體中文翻譯</strong>。</span></h2><p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">其中包含一個 <strong>資源包</strong>，涵蓋 COBBLEVERSE 中所有模組的視覺繁體中文翻譯。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><h3><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若要獲取 Cobbleverse 的繁體中文對話、訓練家名稱及訓練家類型，請下載包含資源包、資料包及設定檔的完整包，可在 Lumyverse Discord (<a href=\"https://discord.gg/zzFvRynA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/zzFvRynA</a>) 的附加組件 (<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252fchannels%252f1144267528638570516%252f1470240945537683638\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">直接連結</a>) 中找到。</span></strong></h3><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">此附加組件的目標是提供 <strong>完全在地化的繁體中文體驗</strong>，忠於原版，同時與 <strong>COBBLEVERSE 及其世界</strong>（選單、物品、訓練家名稱與類型、對話、機制、Lumymon 功能等）相容。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>未修改任何遊戲功能——這<strong>純粹是翻譯</strong>。</em></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><h3><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>安裝指南：</strong></span></h3><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">下載 <em>COBBLEVERSE 1.7.30 Traduction FR Ressourcepacks.zip</em> 檔案，並將其安裝到 Minecraft 客戶端的 <strong>resourcepacks 資料夾</strong>中。請確認它已<strong>啟用並置於第 1 順位</strong>，以確保正確載入。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">就是這樣，<strong style=\"font-size:14px\">Cobbleverse 現在是繁體中文版了！</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><hr><h3><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span><span>法文版本：</span></span></span></em></strong></span></h3><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><h2><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span><span>此附加組件為 </span></span><em><strong><span><span>COBBLEVERSE 1.7.30</span></span></strong></em><span><span> 版本提供了完整的 </span></span><em><strong><span><span>法文</span></span></strong></em><span><span> 翻譯。</span></span></span></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span><span>其中包含一個 </span></span><strong><span><span>資源包</span></span></strong><span><span>，涵蓋 COBBLEVERSE 中所有模組的視覺法文翻譯。</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><h3><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span><span>若要獲取 Cobbleverse 的法文對話、訓練家名稱及類型，請下載包含資源包、資料包及設定檔的完整包，可在 Lumyverse Discord（</span></span><a href=\"https://discord.gg/zzFvRynA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span><span>https://discord.gg/zzFvRynA</span></span></a><span><span>）的附加組件（</span></span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252fchannels%252f1144267528638570516%252f1470240945537683638\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span><span>直接連結</span></span></a><span><span>）中取得。</span></span></span></strong></h3><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span><span>此附加組件的目標是提供 </span></span><strong><span><span>完全法文化且忠於原版的體驗，同時與 COBBLEVERSE 及其世界</span></span></strong><span><span>（選單、物品、訓練家名稱與類型、對話、機制、Lumymon 功能等）相容。</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><span><span>未修改任何遊戲功能——這純粹是翻譯。</span></span></em></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><h3><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span><span>安裝指南：</span></span></strong></span></h3><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span><span>下載 </span></span><em><span><span>COBBLEVERSE 1.7.30 Traduction FR Ressourcepacks.zip</span></span></em><span><span> 檔案，並將其安裝到 Minecraft 客戶端的 </span></span><strong><span><span>資源包資料夾</span></span></strong><span><span> 中。請確認它已 </span></span><strong><span><span>啟用</span></span></strong><span><span> 並 </span></span><strong><span><span>置於第 1 順位</span></span></strong><span><span> 以確保正確載入。</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em><strong><span><span>就是這樣，Cobbleverse 現在是法文版了！</span></span></strong></em></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span><span>COBBLEVERSE 中所包含的已翻譯模組列表：</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- accessories</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- bca</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- beautify</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- carved_wood</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- cobblecuisine</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- cobbledollars</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- cobblefurnies</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- cobblenav</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- cobbleverse</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- cobbleversebadges</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- cobbreeding</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- comforts</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- cozyhome</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- handcrafted</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- legendarymonuments</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- lumymon</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- moarconcrete</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- more_cobblemon_tweaks</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- musicnotification</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- obc</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- pokeblocks</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- rctmod</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- rechiseled</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- roughlyenoughitems</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- sophisticatedbackpacks</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- sophisticatedcore</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- sophisticatedstorage</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- tmcraft</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- waystones</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- xaerominimap</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- xaeroworldmap</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- zamega</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span><span>未包含在 COBBLEVERSE 中但相容的已翻譯模組列表：</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span><span>- catchrate-display<br>- cobbledgacha<br>- cobbledollars_villagers_overhaul_rca<br>- cobblemon_quick_teams</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span><span>- cobblemon_spawn_alerts</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span><span>- cobblemon_utility<br>- cobblemonintegrations<br>- cobblemonmovedex</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span><span>- constructionwand</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span><span>- openpartiesandclaims<br>- patapoke</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- pcenhancements</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span><span>我並非資源包或資料包方面的專家，這只是我在空閒時間製作的。如有翻譯錯誤或任何未翻譯的部分，請隨時告知我！</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1565/277/capture-da-c-cran-2026-02-09-225519-png.png\" alt=\"替代文字\"></span></p>",
